#. +> trunk
#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3675
msgid "Multimedia Library"
msgstr "Multimedia-Bibliotheek"

#. +> trunk
#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3678
msgid "The Multimedia library is a window where you can organize your files, streams and devices; manage your playlists; and choose items for playing. It shows various pieces of information about your media files, and allows you to search and group them, as well as change their properties."
msgstr "De Multimedia-Bibliotheek is en Finster; dor binnen kannst Du Dien Dateien, Strööm, Reedschappen un Afspeellisten plegen un Dateien utsöken, de Du afspelen wullt. Dat wiest en Reeg Informatschonen över Dien Multimediadateien, Du kannst Dateien söken, tohoopkoppeln un ehr Egenschappen bewerken."

#. +> trunk
