#. +> trunk
#: kplayersettingsvideo.ui:261
msgid "Option to choose whether double buffering should be used for video output. This option is recommended, it gives smoother display in many cases."
msgstr "Mit disse Instellen lett sik Dubbelpuffern för de Bildweddergaav anmaken. Dit is anraadt, wiel dat faken en weker Dorstellen praatstellt."

